OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start with some
OL,6,Fbrightness in the east. Showers will
OL,7,Fdevelop from late morning, merging
OL,8,Finto longer spells of heavy rain
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon with some
OL,10,Fthunderstorms also likely.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavy and thundery rain in
OL,13,Fthe evening will ease but a few
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain will continue
OL,15,Fovernight. Becoming breezy with strong
OL,16,Fnorthwest winds over Buchan.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FA mainly cloudy and breezy
OL,19,Fmorning with some patchy light rain.
OL,20,FDry and bright in the afternoon with
OL,21,Fwinds becoming light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
